@baseUrl = https://localhost:7150
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@projectId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@requestId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
# Supply a verified session cookie privately. Do not commit real cookies/tokens.

### Latest 100 customer delivery events; billing-read, tenant scoped
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/alerts/events

### Owner-only project opt-in policy
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/projects/{{projectId}}/payload-retention

### Explicit owner-only audited payload read; missing/expired/outside project => 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/projects/{{projectId}}/payload-retention/requests/{{requestId}}
